# Sentence line breaks

A new sentence must not start with one or two words at the end of a line and then fold. Put the whole sentence on the next line (new `<p>`, or a break after the previous full stop).

Wrong:

```
Initial correspondence is kept strictly confidential unless otherwise agreed. I
respond to all messages within 24 hours.
```

Right:

```
Initial correspondence is kept strictly confidential unless otherwise agreed.
I respond to messages within 24 hours.
```
